#UI BMS4.38 update, December 2023, by Kolbe

#This controls the challenge level window when you start a new
#campaign (clicking on the 'callenge Rating' setting
#It contains
#- setting the challenge rating
#- Campaign name
#- defined difficulty level
#- squadron information
#- Campaign description


##################
